Spec: SDDStages
AN: Analysis
AR: Architecture Review
DB: Database Engineering
BE: Backend Engineering
API: API Engineering
FE: Frontend Engineering
MD: Mobile Engineering
QA: Quality Assurance
DO: DevOps Engineering
VR: Verification
Rules:
  DB applies when persistent data/schema/query behavior changes.
  API applies when an API contract changes.
  BE applies when backend behavior changes.
  FE applies when frontend behavior changes.
  MD applies when mobile behavior changes.
  DO applies when build/deploy/runtime/infrastructure changes.
  QA applies when behavior requires verification.
  VR is the final verification stage.
  Stages are selected from task/project/dependencies/skills, not blindly fixed.
